    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finding Dragons</strong> is a hidden object game featuring adorable dragons tucked away in a beautifully hand-drawn setting. Each dragon has its own name and personality, just like the local residents. Over 100 dragons are waiting for you to find them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ILLUSTRATIONS MADE WITH LOVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the artwork was handcrafted, bringing to life unique dragons, each with their own voice and personality. Can you find them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLICK, EXPLORE, INTERACT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap on elements in the scene, uncover mini-puzzles, and reveal hidden secrets with every click. Every corner holds a surprise\u2014you just need to pay close attention!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEAT THE CLOCK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn on timed mode to challenge your reflexes and beat your own high scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly replayable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >151 dragons await you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 original characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic scenery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i></i></strong><br><br><strong><i>How many can you find?~</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finding Dragons</strong> is a hidden object game featuring adorable dragons tucked away in a beautifully hand-drawn setting. Each dragon has its own name and personality, just like the local residents. Over 100 dragons are waiting for you to find them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ILLUSTRATIONS MADE WITH LOVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the artwork was handcrafted, bringing to life unique dragons, each with their own voice and personality. Can you find them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLICK, EXPLORE, INTERACT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap on elements in the scene, uncover mini-puzzles, and reveal hidden secrets with every click. Every corner holds a surprise\u2014you just need to pay close attention!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEAT THE CLOCK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn on timed mode to challenge your reflexes and beat your own high scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly replayable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >151 dragons await you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 original characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic scenery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i></i></strong><br><br><strong><i>How many can you find?~</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
